Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:02:03.96,Header,,0,0,0,,{\b1}CRAZY RAP{\b0}   |   LINACRE
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.82,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Oi, mind the puddle by the stairwell
Dialogue: 1,0:00:02.84,0:00:04.48,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Kettle on, telly loud
Dialogue: 1,0:00:04.78,0:00:10.28,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Woke up to a council letter stuck to the door,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.32,0:00:12.06,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Said the rent needs sorting - I've heard that before.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:12.10,0:00:13.80,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Down by the bins, Kev's doing deals with a grin,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:14.02,0:00:15.54,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,While Sharon in wellies brings the mud right in.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:15.58,0:00:17.40,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,She's a proper muck magnet, boots full of clay,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:17.44,0:00:19.04,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Says, "Come on, handsome, let's get filthy today."
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.08,0:00:20.90,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,I said, "Love, I've got manners, a mop and a plan,"
Dialogue: 1,0:00:20.94,0:00:22.74,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,She said, "Forget the mop - be a mucky woman's man."
Dialogue: 1,0:00:22.78,0:00:24.52,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Tea in the mug, green in the tin,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:24.56,0:00:26.32,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Neighbours start knocking: "Can we come in?"
Dialogue: 1,0:00:26.36,0:00:27.90,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,One little laugh turns the whole block mad,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:28.12,0:00:29.62,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Best worst evening that we've ever had.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:30.16,0:00:32.02,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Crazy rap from the flats, no lift, just stairs,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:32.06,0:00:33.49,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Mud on the mat and smoke in the airs.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:34.08,0:00:35.38,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Mucky woman dancing like she owns the hall,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:35.80,0:00:37.14,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Puns so rude make the plaster fall.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.38,0:00:38.58,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Crazy rap, let the whole block sing,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:39.08,0:00:40.24,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Council-estate royalty, plastic-gold ring.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:40.28,0:00:42.00,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,If life gets grim, we make it slap,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:42.04,0:00:43.70,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Put the kettle on - it's the crazy rap!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.74,0:00:45.58,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,She said, "You're a grass," I said, "No, I'm a sage,"
Dialogue: 1,0:00:45.62,0:00:47.28,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,She said, "That's not a herb, that's a landlord's rage."
Dialogue: 1,0:00:47.32,0:00:48.99,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Got a spliff in the garden, but the garden's a tray,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:49.32,0:00:50.82,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Three dead plants and a fox that won't go away.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:50.86,0:00:52.60,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Her coat's second-hand but her attitude's new,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:52.64,0:00:54.40,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Got mud on her leggings and a point of view.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:54.44,0:00:56.12,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,She called me a stud - I said, "That's a screw,"
Dialogue: 1,0:00:56.16,0:00:57.88,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now I'm fixing the cupboard while she fixes my mood.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.92,0:00:59.64,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Bangers in the kitchen, bass through the wall,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:59.68,0:01:01.54,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Someone's burnt the toast, but we're blaming the hall.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.58,0:01:03.14,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,The dog's got my slipper, the cat's got the cap,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.34,0:01:04.90,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Everybody's skanking to the crazy rap.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:05.42,0:01:07.34,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Crazy rap from the flats, no lift, just stairs,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.38,0:01:08.75,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Mud on the mat and smoke in the airs.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.32,0:01:10.62,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Mucky woman dancing like she owns the hall,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:11.06,0:01:12.42,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Puns so rude make the plaster fall.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:12.46,0:01:13.70,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Crazy rap, let the whole block sing,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:14.52,0:01:15.52,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Council-estate royalty, plastic-gold ring.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:15.56,0:01:17.26,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,If life gets grim, we make it slap,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:17.30,0:01:18.92,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Put the kettle on - it's the crazy rap!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:18.96,0:01:20.88,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,She said, "Call me dirty," I said, "That's your brand,"
Dialogue: 1,0:01:20.92,0:01:22.60,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,She slipped in the puddle and still took my hand.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:22.64,0:01:24.40,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,We laughed so hard that the neighbours complained,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.44,0:01:26.02,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Then borrowed our sugar and came back again.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.06,0:01:29.14,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,No palace, no marble, no chandelier,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.14,0:01:31.56,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Just love by the launderette and a bargain-bin beer.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:35.08,0:01:37.24,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Crazy rap from the flats, no lift, just stairs,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:37.28,0:01:39.06,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Mud on the mat and smoke in the airs.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:39.30,0:01:40.50,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Mucky woman dancing like she owns the hall,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:41.10,0:01:42.34,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Puns so rude make the plaster fall.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:42.38,0:01:43.64,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Crazy rap, let the whole block sing,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:44.44,0:01:45.42,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Council-estate royalty, plastic-gold ring.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:45.46,0:01:47.18,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,If life gets grim, we make it slap,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:47.22,0:01:49.04,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Put the kettle on - it's the crazy rap!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.08,0:01:50.68,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Mind the step, mind the mop,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.96,0:01:52.56,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Mind that woman - she don't stop.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:52.60,0:01:54.30,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Green in the tin, tea in the cup,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:54.34,0:01:55.96,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Estate life down, but the chorus up.
